	(text "01_POWER Detailed Gate A rev0.2  External +-12V 1A bench via J1 screw terminal\nF1/F2 polyfuse 500mA + SS14 reverse Schottky D1/D2 + TVS SMAJ12A (DNP) per rail. Bulk 47uF 25V X5R + 10uF + 100nF.\n+12V_A/-12V_A are RAW filtered (Option A: LT1970 + AD5764 run from RAW +-12V, 0.6V margin on AD5764 11.4V min (insufficient at ±12V ±5% -> 11.4V exactly, no drop/ripple margin; REQUIREDGuaranteed at IC >=11.8V -> bench 12.5V ±2% or rail-valid 11.6V comparator, see DEC-038)). No +-10V LDO (IR-07).\n+5V_A via LT3045EDD (VIN 12V_A, SET 12.4k=5.0V, 10uF OUT, 10uF IN, 4.7uF SET cap, PG 100k to 3V3). PSRR 120dB, 0.8uVrms.\n+3V3 via TLV1117LV33 from +5V_A, 10uF+100nF. Supervision: TPS3808G33 senses +3V3 (Vth2.93), delay 200ms, open-drain RESET_N with 10k PU to 3V3.\nRefs: LTC6655BHMS8-5.0 VIN +5V_A -> VREF_5V for AD5764 REFAB/REFCD. LTC6655BHMS8-2.5 -> VREF_2V5 for ADS1262. Each: 0.1uF VIN, 10uF+0.1uF VOUT (DS 2.7-50uF), 0.1uF NR. Lone-star routing, Kelvin at load.\nPOR/Rail-valid: TPS3808 RESET_N drives OE gate via 1k series + 100nF debounce + 10k PD safe default. HW pulldown 10k on OUTPUT_ENABLE ensures disabled at power-up/brown-out/MCU high-Z. 200ms POR matches Test L. AND with MCU GPIO via 74LVC1G08 (DNP provision).\nPower domains table below. TPs 1-8. All power nets have PWR_FLAG. Decoupling within 2mm of IC." (at 10 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))))
	(text "Power Domain Table (Option A - V1 baseline, raw +12V_A for power stage)\nRail          Source          Voltage   Current   Consumer                          Filter/Reg class\n+12V_A        J1+12V->F1/D1   +12V raw  ~200mA    LT1970A power stage AVDD          47uF bulk + ferrite + 100nF\n-12V_A        J1-12V->F2/D2   -12V raw  ~200mA    LT1970A AVSS + AD5764 AVSS        47uF bulk + ferrite + 100nF\n+5V_A         LT3045 from +12V_A +5.0V  ~300mA   LTC6655 refs + OPA140 analog + LT3045 SET  10uH LC pi + LT3045 0.8uVrms\n+3V3          TLV1117 from +5V_A 3.3V   ~200mA   STM32G474 + digital + supervisor   10uF+100nF\nVREF_5V       LTC6655-5.0 from +5V_A 5.0V  5mA    AD5764 REFAB+REFCD (spec condition) 10uF+0.1uF OUT 0.1uF NR 0.775uVpp\nVREF_2V5      LTC6655-2.5 from +5V_A 2.5V 5mA    ADS1262 VREF (midscale 2.5V)       10uF+0.1uF OUT 0.1uF NR\nGND           star plane      0V       -       one continuous plane, no split (IR-13)  placement + via stitch + decoupling\nNote: AD5764 AVDD/AVSS =RAW +-12V_A satisfies 11.4V min (insufficient at ±12V ±5% -> 11.4V exactly, no drop/ripple margin; REQUIREDGuaranteed at IC >=11.8V -> bench 12.5V ±2% or rail-valid 11.6V comparator, see DEC-038); do NOT derive +-10V LDO (IR-07). LT1763 class only for positive +5V_A." (at 10 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9))))
)
